# QA (M2, D-045): a relaxed, imperfect full run of Stage 2 at walking pace
# (handwritten, no solver prefix; RB only for two short run-ups). Busbahnhof:
# bumps the M-box from below and waits for the Mozartkugel (PowerUp), walking
# jump over the shelter wall through the Oblaten arc, hops over walker #1,
# waits at the planter until walker #2 turns and stomps it from behind,
# stomps the forecourt tourist. Talstation: waits on the station platform for
# Gondel A (one full lap), rides it, waits on the knoll for Gondel B (another
# lap), rides it to the pylon, waits there for Gondel C and rides it down.
# Mozartplatz: lets the sitting Taube rise and pass, climbs the fountain rim
# for the arc Oblaten, gets hurt by the tourist pinned against the rim (back
# to Normal), stomps two tourists, crosses the souvenir-stand roof over the
# Verkaeufer, walks under the Gastgarten. Ischler Strasse: checkpoint, stomps
# tourist #5, bumps the M-box (Zuckerschock again), balcony route B1 (jumps
# over walker #4) -> B2 (stomps walker #5) -> B3 -> B4 -> bandstand roof.
# Seepromenade: waits on the bench through one note train, runs in and stomps
# Blasmusiker #2. Pier: walking jumps, stomps the jetty walker, over the kiosk
# roof and a walking jump to the pole (100). 75 of 85 Oblaten.
# Maibaum touch at frame 4080 = 68 s (D-045: 3 x 68 = 204 -> 210 s).
